      "title": "Separate external actions and make compensation explicit",
      "implementation": "OrderService depends on PaymentGateway and SupplySystem interfaces. It checks availability, performs payment, requests supply, records per-store orders, and attempts payment/supply cancellation on a later supply failure. Unit tests substitute Mockito adapters and inspect inventory and order state.",
